<section id='sec-6' class='block'>
<div class='act'><span class='act-num'>{{ _("— Scene VI") }}</span><span class='act-sep'></span><span class='act-tag'>{{ _("Artifact 06") }}</span></div><h1 class='sec-h1'><span>{{ _("Solution Design") }}</span> <em class='brass'>{{ _("(Marcus — Solution Architect)") }}</em></h1>
<p>{{ _("The target architecture: data model, security, automation, integrations, UI. This is the longest section of the SDS — Marcus must produce this in enough detail for BUILD agents (Diego/Zara) to implement without inventing missing pieces.") }}</p>
<p class='note'>{{ _("This section is the primary input to all BUILD-phase agents. Every gap or vagueness here translates into improvisation by Diego (Apex), Zara (LWC), Raj (Admin) and Jordan (DevOps).") }}</p>
<h2 id='sub-6-1' class='sec-h2'><span>{{ _("6.1 Data Model") }}</span> <em class='brass'>{{ _("Entity Relationship Diagram") }}</em></h2>
<p>{{ _("The target data model has") }} {{ data_model.standard_objects | length }} {{ _("standard objects extended,") }} {{ data_model.custom_objects | length }} {{ _("new custom objects, and") }} {{ data_model.relationships | length }} {{ _("relationships.") }}</p>
<div class='figure-block'><div class='figure-caption'>{{ _("Figure 1 — Target ERD (") }}{{ data_model.custom_objects | length }} {{ _("custom objects,") }} {{ data_model.relationships | length }} {{ _("relationships) — generated from the ERD block written by Marcus") }}</div>
<div class='mermaid-wrap'><pre class="mermaid">
{{ (data_model.erd_mermaid if 'erd_mermaid' in data_model else '') | mermaid_safe }}
</pre></div>
</div>
<h2 id='sub-6-2' class='sec-h2'><span>{{ _("6.2 Custom Objects") }}</span> <em class='brass'>({{ data_model.custom_objects | length }})</em></h2>
